{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13224430","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13224430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322443001:1":{"text":"예배... 의식... 이교도들이 점점 더 대담해지고 있군요!","source_cn":"礼拜……祭祀……这些邪教徒真是越来越猖狂了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF43B7D95E32FD9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322443002:1":{"text":"그것 뿐만이 아니에요. 이번 의식에는 고위층 이교도들도 많이 올 거라고요.","source_cn":"不仅如此，这次祭祀很多邪教徒的高层也会参加。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9419918D2C1EBBE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322443003:1":{"text":"그들을 일망타진할 절호의 기회입니다. 이번에는 절대 놓치지 않겠어요!","source_cn":"这是将他们一网打尽的好机会。这回我一定不会放过它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D9D114EC44B0DA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322443004:1":{"text":"로드리고 씨, 이리나의 집이 어디에 있는지 아시나요?","source_cn":"对了，罗德里戈先生，你清楚伊琳娜的家在哪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF05E1408B4B1E112","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322443005:1":{"text":"방금 전 예배에서 이리나를 봤어요. 걱정이 돼서 직접 찾아가 보려고요.","source_cn":"我们在刚才的礼拜中看到了伊琳娜，很担心她的情况，想要去...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x918657C3D5F7F4FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322443006:1":{"text":"신경 써주셔서 감사합니다. 이리나의 집은 <style=\"stress\">시더 마을 남쪽</style>에 <style=\"stress\">홀로 떨어진 집</style>이라 찾기 쉬우실 겁니다.","source_cn":"让你们费心了。她家在<style=stress>雪松镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46A4CFDD3B41BCF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"근위대장 로드리고","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}